  "notes": [
    "SEWCP-301 choke washers (16x Ti, 1.50) are deliberately unmodelled (CP package: pads are treatment zones, washer supplies the gap) - the HP placement at 41.5 represents them; BOM carries them from spec/00 s4.2/s9.",
