    "SR as-supplied 20.30 model placed with top at 20.000 (lap-to-fit DR-3): 0.30 lap allowance shows below Datum A by representation.",
    "Lift pin park Z is actuator-defined; 1.0 recess below the ESC face chosen and recorded (not a spec value).",
    "Saddle placement provisional under ECR-Q-012; strap seat convention 0.25 discrepancy recorded there.",
    "Assembly-level interference is verified at the z-band/placement level here; feature fits are the 12/12 component-level evidence."
